      "description": "The Cavern of Souls is set to Shapeshifter instead of Goblin, meaning it can't be used to cast any of the Goblin creatures in hand (Goblin Matron, Munitions Expert, Broadside Bombardiers). However, Aether Vial is at 2 charge counters, which means it can put 2-mana creatures (Munitions Expert) onto the battlefield. The player should activate Aether Vial to put a Munitions Expert into play at end of opponent's turn. With Skirk Prospector and the Munitions Expert on the battlefield, that's 2 Goblins, so Munitions Expert's ETB trigger could deal 2 damage to the opponent or any creature. This is a free, instant-speed play that develops the board and deals damage, and there's no reason not to do it at end of opponent's turn.",
