      "better_line": "Activate Aether Vial (2 charge counters) to put Munitions Expert onto the battlefield for free, triggering its ETB to deal 2 damage (2 Goblins in play) to the opponent's face or a relevant target.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 63,
      "player": "GPT5n Snark",
      "decision_index": 44,
