    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "When forced to discard to hand size, the player discarded Atraxa, Grand Unifier. While they still have another copy of Atraxa in hand, discarding Ponder would have been better. Ponder is a 1-mana cantrip that becomes nearly irrelevant once the player resolves Show and Tell into Omniscience (their primary game plan). Keeping both Ataxas maximizes the value if the first Show and Tell gets countered or if the opponent puts something problematic onto the battlefield — having a second Atraxa as a backup threat or as a cast off Omniscience for the massive card advantage ETB is more valuable than a Ponder. Additionally, Emrakul's graveyard trigger will shuffle the graveyard back into the library, but Atraxa doesn't have that protection, so the discarded Atraxa is effectively gone.",
